title: Campaigning
new-page: true
view-if: not rubicon or campaigning_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; campaigning_timer += 2 if rubicon
is-card: true
card-image: img/flags.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs

= Campaigning

Whether or not we are in an electoral campaign, the party is always trying to broaden its voter base. Who should we focus our campaign efforts on?

- @workers: The urban working class, who traditionally support the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>.
- @new_middle: The "new middle class" of government employees and white-collar workers.
- @old_middle: The "old middle class" of small independent businessmen and artisans.
- @rural: Rural workers and small farmers, who predominantly support the <span style="color: #003755;">right</span>.
- @unemployed: The unemployed.
- @bdf: We can sponsor *Bund Deutscher Frauenvereine* for an extensive campaign among women.
- @catholics: Catholics, our traditional support base.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
- @easy_discard

@workers
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: workers_z += 4*(1-dissent); workers_z -= 1 if unemployed >= 20; workers_z -= 1 if unemployed >= 30; workers_z += 3*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted = 1; resources -= 1; workers_z += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress >= 1;

We have increased our campaigning among the workers. [? if unemployed >= 15: The high levels of unemployment make our campaign more difficult. ?][? if wtb_adopted = 1 : Adopting the WTB plan gives us a new rallying point around which to attract workers. ?]

@new_middle
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: new_middle_z += 6*(1-dissent) resources -= 1;

We have increased our campaigning among the new middle class.
@old_middle
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: old_middle_z += 5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; old_middle_z -= 3 

We have increased our campaigning among the old middle class.
@rural
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: rural_z += 5*(1-dissent); 

We have increased our campaigning among farmers. [? if peoples_party == 0: We have not historically campaigned much among the farmers, and they do not trust us. ?][? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among farmers than before. ?][? if rural_policy >= 2 : Our rural policies have made it easier for us to build support among farmers. ?][? if rural_conscious == 1: As we have awakened the class consciousness of the peasantry and the rural working class, we have an easier time increasing support amongst them. ?]


@unemployed
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: unemployed_z += 4*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; unemployed_z -= 3 if welfare < 0; unemployed_spd -= 2 if unemployed >= 30; unemployed_z += 6*(1-dissent) if wtb_adopted = 1; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare >= 2;

We have increased our campaigning among the unemployed. [? if welfare < 0: The welfare cuts and resultant poverty make our campaign more difficult, since we are associated with the government that enacted these cuts, and our campaign may even backfire. ?][? if wtb_adopted = 1 : Adopting the WTB plan gives us a new rallying point around which to attract support from the unemployed. ?]

@bdf
view-if: bdf_cooperation
subtitle: -1 resources.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_z += 4*(1-dissent); new_middle_z += 4*(1-dissent); old_middle_z += 3*(1-dissent); rural_z += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_z += 3*(1-dissent); catholics_z += 1*(1-dissent);

We have coordinated with BDF to campaign among women across all classes.

@catholics
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: peoples_party == 1
on-arrival: catholics_z += 6*(1-dissent); resources -= 1

We have increased our campaigning among Catholics.
